            "review_title": "Review at Dachazz Gastro Lounge",
            "review_text": "Drifter\nPhong Nha-Ke Bang National Park, Vietnam4619 contributions\n0\nFinally reopened\nApr 2022\nAs before the setting and new decor are beautiful, the staff is great as before. Location on the new walking street is still a few steps from the sand of DaNang beach. Great coffee and good full breakfast. Still top notch service and don’t miss the Hot Stone Pho. The most unique and delicious presentation of the Vietnamese national dish you will ever have. Be patient with the construction going on in the area, it’s going to be great when it’s finished.\nWritten April 22, 2022",
